/*
  EventTimeline.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 feature view · 0043 · EventTimeline (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. Every key the native
  `EventTimeline` resolves (table "EventTimeline") lives here with its web `t(key,
  default)` English value. These entries fold into the app `Localizable.xcstrings` master
  catalog at integration time; they are kept in a per-surface table so each parallel
  surface prompt owns its own strings without editing the shared catalog.

  The first group is the exact set of keys extracted from the web source
  (features/admin/components/security-access/EventTimeline.tsx — the title, the
  useTimelineLabels titles/descriptions, and the EmptyState message). The second group
  backs the native-only chrome (freshness chip / connectivity banner / loading / error /
  retry / accessibility) the Apple HIG states contract requires.
*/

